        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "6. Removing the five factors of 10 leaves $2^2\\cdot3^2=36$.",
          "worked": "Remove all factors of 10:\n$$\\begin{align*}2^7\\cdot3^2\\cdot5^5 &= 2^2\\cdot3^2\\cdot(2\\cdot5)^5\\\\2^7\\cdot3^2\\cdot5^5 &= 36\\cdot10^5\\end{align*}$$\nThe last non-zero digit is 6.",
